┌─ SOVEREIGN TOOLS (the only MCP interface) ──────────────────┐
│                                                              │
│  CLIENT ──MCP──▶ :3030/sse or /messages                     │
│                                                              │
│  tylluan_do ────▶ natural language → router → guild → result │
│  tylluan_remember ▶ content → SilvaDB node (embeddings+graph)│
│  tylluan_recall ──▶ query → BM25+vector+rerank → top results │
│  tylluan_think ───▶ query → graph traversal → analysis       │
│  tylluan_graph ───▶ add_triple|query_path|stats|ppr          │
│                                                              │
│  Defined:  transport/server/tools.rs → all_tools()          │
│  INVARIANT: exactly 5 tools, always.                        │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

