┌─ GUILD SYSTEM (Python subprocesses via fastmcp) ────────────┐
│                                                              │
│  guilds/core/       42 guilds auto-discovered               │
│  Always-on (tylluan.toml always_on):                        │
│    bash, filesystem, monitor, system_metrics, vision        │
│    knowledge, coloquio, websearch, deep_web_research        │
│    code_graph, scrapling, scheduler                         │
│                                                             │
│  On-demand (lazy):                                          │
│    coordinator, git, docker, code, database, ingest         │
│    pdf, deep_analysis, navigator, codebase_memory ...       │
│                                                              │
│  KEY: scheduler.py MUST have entry point at end:            │
│    if __name__ == "__main__": utils.safe_mcp_run(mcp)       │
│    Without it: process exits → supervisor crash loop        │
│    Fixed: commit dcbff04                                    │
│                                                              │
│  Routing: catalog.rs trigger_phrases per guild              │
│  Spawn:   registry/supervisor.rs manages lifecycle          │
│  Config:  tylluan.toml [guilds.core] always_on list         │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─ DATA LAYER ────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                              │
│  data/silva.db        knowledge graph (nodes, edges, FTS5)  │
│  data/active_port.json  runtime port (3030 by default,       │
│                          written by kernel at actual bind)   │
│  data/scheduler.db    scheduler persistence                 │
│                                                              │
│  Embeddings: BGE-M3 via fastembed-rs (ONNX, DirectML GPU)  │
│  Reranker:   Jina reranker-v1-turbo (ONNX)                 │
│  Vectors:    768-dim BGE-M3                                 │
│  Search:     BM25 (FTS5) + vector + rerank + LinearRAG      │
│  M21 Cache:  query_cache.rs — normalize → Mutex<HashMap>    │
│              TTL 300s, max 256 LRU, invalidated on remember │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

